model se_w_eq
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the plan's §8.4: book/same_booking.rs same_end, the guard amounts_agree set to false (MUTANTS-SURVIVORS). Two movements stated same, equal amounts: i1's day a window row, a hole day in 2.3, i2's 2026-03-07 inside it. What the place takes from them, before, inside and after the window, plain and pinned at both ends"

source s "s"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place wal: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input di: date
input d7: date
input a: money PLN

move i1: transfers
  on di
  leg cash from world to wal amount a

move i2: transfers
  on d7
  leg cash from world to wal amount a

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[wal] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  di = window(2026-03-03, 2026-03-09) "s"
  d7 = 2026-03-07 "s"
  a = 100.00 PLN "s"

version later
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-05-01
  same i1 = i2

ask b_feb: bal(wal, 2026-02-28)
ask b_in: bal(wal, 2026-03-05)
ask b_mar: bal(wal, 2026-03-31)
ask f_mar: flows(wal, 2026-03)
ask n_mar: count(m in transfers over 2026-03)
ask b_mar_p03: bal(wal, 2026-03-31) with di = 2026-03-03
ask b_mar_p09: bal(wal, 2026-03-31) with di = 2026-03-09
ask b_mar_k: bal(wal, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-15
